Source: pglite-fusion
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), cargo, clang, rustc
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/frectonz/pglite-fusion

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-pglite-fusion
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-pglite-fusion
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: embed SQLite databases in PostgreSQL values
 pglite_fusion provides an SQLite value type and functions for querying and
 modifying embedded SQLite databases. This package builds PostgreSQL 14-18.
